# This file exists so the empty public/ directory is committed to git.
# Vercel requires an outputDirectory after the build step. The API project
# has no static frontend - it is serverless functions only - but Vercel
# still validates that the configured output directory exists. Pointing
# outputDirectory at this empty folder satisfies the check without
# masking the api/index.ts serverless function (which is what happened
# when we previously set outputDirectory to "dist").
